{"nodes": [{"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "label": "Skill /graphify", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Convierte cualquier carpeta (c\u00f3digo, docs, papers, im\u00e1genes, v\u00eddeo) en un grafo de conocimiento navegable, persistente entre sesiones y con auditor\u00eda honesta."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_fast_path_existing_graph", "label": "Fast path: grafo ya existente", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Si graphify-out/graph.json existe y la pregunta es natural sobre el c\u00f3digo, se salta la construcci\u00f3n entera y se responde con graphify query: el grafo ya est\u00e1 construido, hay que usarlo."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_detect_files", "label": "Paso 2 \u2014 Detecci\u00f3n del corpus", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El JSON de detecci\u00f3n no se imprime: se lee en silencio y se presenta un resumen limpio. Corpus grandes (>2M palabras o >500 archivos) obligan a acotar por subcarpeta."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_ast_structural_extraction", "label": "Parte A \u2014 Extracci\u00f3n estructural AST", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Determinista, gratuita y sin LLM: un corpus solo de c\u00f3digo se extrae entero por AST y se salta la parte sem\u00e1ntica."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction", "label": "Parte B \u2014 Extracci\u00f3n sem\u00e1ntica con subagentes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Obligatorio usar la herramienta Agent en paralelo (5-10x m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido que leer archivos uno a uno) y siempre subagent_type general-purpose, porque Explore es read-only y descarta los resultados en silencio."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_no_api_key_rule", "label": "graphify no necesita API key", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El c\u00f3digo se extrae por AST sin LLM; la parte sem\u00e1ntica usa Gemini solo si GEMINI_API_KEY/GOOGLE_API_KEY ya est\u00e1 puesta, y si no, el propio agente anfitri\u00f3n es el LLM. Pedir ANTHROPIC_API_KEY es una mala lectura de la skill."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_extraction_cache", "label": "Cach\u00e9 de extracci\u00f3n sem\u00e1ntica", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Las entradas se atribuyen al prompt (SPEC_PATH) que las produjo: al cambiar el prompt se re-extrae en vez de reproducir resultados viejos."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_chunking_strategy", "label": "Troceado en chunks de 20-25 archivos", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cada imagen va en su propio chunk (la visi\u00f3n necesita contexto separado) y los archivos del mismo directorio se agrupan para que salgan m\u00e1s relaciones cross-file."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_merge_ast_semantic", "label": "Parte C \u2014 Fusi\u00f3n de AST y sem\u00e1ntico", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los nodos AST van primero y los sem\u00e1nticos se deduplican por id, de modo que la extracci\u00f3n estructural manda sobre la inferida."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_community_detection", "label": "Detecci\u00f3n de comunidades y cohesi\u00f3n", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Las comunidades se etiquetan a mano con un nombre de 2-5 palabras y se re-exporta graph.json para que los nodos lleven el community_name curado."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_god_nodes", "label": "God nodes y conexiones sorprendentes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Son los hubs arquitect\u00f3nicos: por d\u00f3nde entrar a un repo desconocido, y las conexiones que cruzan fronteras de comunidad."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graph_health_check", "label": "Paso 4.5 \u2014 Chequeo de salud del grafo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Diagn\u00f3stico read-only que nunca aborta: revela colapso de aristas, extremos colgantes/ausentes y self-loops, los modos de corrupci\u00f3n silenciosa de los updates incrementales y de los desajustes de id entre AST y LLM."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_shrink_guard", "label": "Guardia anti-encogimiento de graph.json", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "to_json se niega a escribir si el grafo nuevo tiene menos nodos que el existente, y GRAPH_REPORT.md solo se escribe si el grafo se escribi\u00f3, para que nunca describa un grafo que graph.json no contiene."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_empty_graph_guard", "label": "Guardia de grafo vac\u00edo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La comprobaci\u00f3n va ANTES de cualquier escritura: una extracci\u00f3n vac\u00eda no debe pisar un graph.json bueno."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_manifest_stamping", "label": "Sellado del manifiesto para --update", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Solo se sellan los archivos sem\u00e1nticos que produjeron salida: un archivo cuyo chunk fall\u00f3 debe quedar sin sellar para que el siguiente --update lo re-encole, o su contenido se pierde para siempre."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_cost_tracker", "label": "Rastreador acumulado de coste", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cada run a\u00f1ade sus tokens a cost.json y el reporte siempre muestra el coste, por la regla de honestidad."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_query", "label": "/graphify query \u2014 traves\u00eda del grafo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Antes de la traves\u00eda se expande la pregunta contra el vocabulario del propio grafo, para que un desajuste de redacci\u00f3n no colapse la respuesta en ruido."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_honesty_rules", "label": "Reglas de honestidad", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nunca inventar una arista (ante la duda, AMBIGUOUS), nunca saltarse el aviso de corpus, siempre mostrar el coste en tokens y nunca esconder las cohesiones tras s\u00edmbolos."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_interpreter_resolution", "label": "Resoluci\u00f3n del int\u00e9rprete de Python", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "uv \u2192 pipx \u2192 entorno activo, y la ruta se escribe sin BOM porque Out-File en PowerShell 5.1 lo a\u00f1ade siempre y ese BOM rompe el rebuild del hook con WinError 123."}], "edges": [{"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_fast_path_existing_graph", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_detect_files", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_ast_structural_extraction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_no_api_key_rule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_extraction_cache", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_chunking_strategy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_merge_ast_semantic", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_community_detection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_god_nodes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graph_health_check", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_shrink_guard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_empty_graph_guard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_manifest_stamping", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_cost_tracker", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_query", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_honesty_rules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_interpreter_resolution", "relat